From ef5d8df8f96e72a5138783799bcc3a6146980d1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BellSoft <info@bell-sw.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:33:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vendorjdk): one package type per product family of the
 module

osv-internal 0.5.5 replaces its EcosystemJDK/EcosystemNIK constants by the
Products table: a vendor may build the module with several JDK and NIK
families. vendordb maps every family to a package type and a severity source
named by the family's purl name (LangTypeOf, LangTypes, ProductForLangType,
SourceOf, ProductSources); the analyzer, the detector, the purl mapping and
the SBOM lifting of runtimes follow, and the fixed VendorJDK/VendorNIK types
are gone.
